Comment: 0,0:01:59.56,0:02:06.24,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,They say the cute prince sets sail!
Comment: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.16,Karaoke - 06 the pixie and the giants - Tink's Sailing Song,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k11}{\k20}Hi{\k19}mi{\k29}tsu {\k21}no {\k25}ne{\k25}ga{\k25}i {\k115}yo
Comment: 0,0:02:06.26,0:02:09.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Oh, secret wish...
Comment: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.82,Karaoke - 06 the pixie and the giants - Tink's Sailing Song,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k10}{\k21}Ka{\k19}na{\k25}e{\k25}te {\k25}ku{\k60}re{\k126}ru
Comment: 0,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,Will you grant it?
Comment: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:19.34,Karaoke - 06 the pixie and the giants - Tink's Sailing Song,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k45}{\k20}Ma{\k46}ho{\k24}u {\k36}no {\k15}o{\k34}u{\k98}ji {\k75}ga{\k37} {\k33}i{\k19}ku {\k24}so{\k66}u {\k76}na
Comment: 0,0:02:12.86,0:02:19.34,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,karaoke,They say the magical prince sets sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's uncool, I'm the one who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.64,0:02:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cool, very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.82,0:02:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, off I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shell!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.23,0:03:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading over to Lord Nylon, who is tailing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.22,0:03:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it’s Golden Week...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.99,0:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke Duralumin's orders were to secretly spy on Sapphire while he’s playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s that little angel again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A little person came out of the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.61,0:03:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A little person from a shell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.70,0:03:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was trapped in the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He says this child was on a distant southern island.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.73,0:03:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he was trapped inside the shell and drifted all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.99,0:03:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s your papa’s name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Genie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of Genie, isn’t that the name of the genie of the lamp from the Arabian Nights?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that genie your papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:04:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He used to be in a lamp, but now he’s free and living on an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The genie of the magic lamp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly, a magic lamp is for making wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,My papa used to do whatever the person holding the lamp told him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's not in that line of work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you saved me, if I tell him, I’m sure he’ll grant your wish in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To where my papa is on the southern island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.43,0:04:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please. Hey, I’m begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thats...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, let's just dump this runt somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.07,0:04:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just talking nonsense about his dad being a magic lamp genie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s true!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see if you take me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.29,0:04:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, we have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.04,0:04:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.79,0:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A genie of the lamp who grants any wish, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, if I can just get my hands on that runt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.22,0:05:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't Lord Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.17,0:05:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It certainly is a nice day...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.94,0:05:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I've come to escort Your Highness back to the castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, in that case, go straight to the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Go straight there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I tricked him good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine. I'll take the little guy to the house on the southern island all by myself, so there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.66,0:05:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.53,0:05:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange, make sure Papa grants my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over that little person!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:05:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:05:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I already said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.03,0:06:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.75,0:06:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a little kid playing by himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.90,0:06:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.26,0:06:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you not to go, so there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.86,0:06:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking the little guy to where Papa is, so there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't possibly go to a southern island!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.98,0:06:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.74,0:06:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen to me! If you go out to sea, there are terrifying, poisonous jellyfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And man-eating sharks, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.35,0:06:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone, leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.12,0:06:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.55,0:06:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobito-kun, stay hidden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.44,0:06:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.62,0:06:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.72,0:06:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.20,0:07:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Row!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.62,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.52,0:08:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kujira-san, for eating the man-eating shark!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink is in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and catch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.92,0:08:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.73,0:08:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,An insane whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab onto this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.10,0:09:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm taken any further than this, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to crash into the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.93,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.18,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.42,0:10:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.46,0:10:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a southern island!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.90,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do about Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.54,0:12:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to signal them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if I'll find Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.98,0:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it a mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.99,0:12:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.46,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.12,0:12:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So many of them came!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.44,0:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.34,0:12:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming out, they're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The trees and flowers, everything is so tiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.45,0:12:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's Kubito-kun's island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Kubito-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's scary, it's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.00,0:12:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.52,0:12:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.32,0:12:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?! It looks like a fly-sized dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.72,0:13:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.56,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.00,0:13:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, I get it, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.50,0:13:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave this island too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to leave, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.02,0:13:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn into this and get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.27,0:13:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You dirty little tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.74,0:13:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Uwaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.58,0:13:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.25,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like Tink was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There are Tink's footprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.26,0:14:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.47,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They disappear here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.50,0:14:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.79,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.11,0:14:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, um, this place is... ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.78,0:14:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Giants?!\N- Don't be afraid, little elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, that last place was apparently the Island of Tradition, but this time it's the Island of Giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.90,0:14:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know what might come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.98,0:14:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.06,0:14:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything and anything is as huge as a mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.04,0:14:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve landed on one heck of an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit ribbit ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.54,0:15:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t eat me! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.46,0:15:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.50,0:15:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.20,0:15:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.85,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.74,0:15:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't shake like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I said don't sha....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant man!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.10,0:16:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Giant frogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.60,0:16:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.90,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.86,0:16:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.99,0:16:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The frog called out to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We... please help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "help me"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbit ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.84,0:16:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,One of you is being eaten every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,By whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.69,0:16:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.43,0:16:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even get a word out!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.96,0:16:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.57,0:17:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This frog has some paralysis medicine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.20,0:17:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s Tinku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.44,0:17:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.54,0:17:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.72,0:17:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tinku!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.29,0:17:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s a giant monster; we can’t defeat him by normal means!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a dead end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ll be killed if you stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.69,0:18:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Those kaeru-kun... Kaeru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, where did you get that paralysis medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.18,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,From the root of the paralysis plant, ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.97,0:18:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbit ribbit, ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.02,0:18:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Put all of it in your mouths, and spit it at that giant all at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.58,0:18:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Where to, ribbit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,At his feet! The giant's feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.60,0:18:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbit ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.26,0:18:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll cut off at least one of your fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.31,0:19:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.02,0:19:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ribbit ribbit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.17,0:19:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the paralysis medicine in your mouth... 3, 2, 1, zero!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.04,0:19:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.34,0:19:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He's hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.64,0:20:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's running away, but I wonder what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.70,0:20:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that too much for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.84,0:20:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a relief!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.42,0:20:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Say thank you to the frogs, they drove the giant man away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Frogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.10,0:20:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Frogs dealt with a giant man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.85,0:20:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, lure the giant man over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.05,0:20:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Chomp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, he's climbed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't defeat the giant man this time, it's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One more left!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.51,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.53,0:21:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.44,0:21:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.18,0:21:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you no, things are crazy right now, you shouldn't come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my island!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.17,0:21:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Horns are growing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.81,0:21:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get angry, my horn comes out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't kill Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.71,0:21:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.46,0:21:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bakun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakun?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.16,0:21:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.62,0:21:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, I missed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.86,0:21:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That child and the man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.62,0:22:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.82,0:22:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you made it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.86,0:22:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This person is the only good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought me home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.70,0:22:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa was so worried he couldn't even eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.22,0:22:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this man the one responsible for that magic lamp?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.56,0:22:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakun, you must never go out to play alone again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.05,0:22:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.30,0:22:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not leaving anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.92,0:22:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for making you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,As a thank you, let me grant your wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I misunderstood too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.66,0:22:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We’re even!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.47,0:22:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to repay your kindness!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.73,0:23:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, pray that happiness comes to Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.39,0:23:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.32,0:23:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make my own happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa said the Your Highness is being targeted by bad people!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that won't tear us apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A man named Lord Nylon even chased us to this island!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.98,0:23:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he was a suspicious guy, so I used magic to turn him into a stupid duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.67,0:23:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A magic duck?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.54,0:23:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.57,0:23:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Genie!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.48,0:23:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to change Lord Nylon back from that stupid duck later!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This should have taught Lord Nylon a bit of a lesson...
